  "body_html": "<h1>liftCert_nonneg</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem liftCert_nonneg (A : I → Fin (n+1) → 𝕜) {u' : FMRowIndex A → 𝕜} (hu' : ∀ idx, 0 ≤ u' idx) (i : I) : 0 ≤ liftCert A u' i</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>FMRowIndex</li>\n<li>liftCert</li>\n<li>liftCoeff_inl</li>\n<li>liftCoeff_inr</li>\n<li>liftCoeff</li>\n<li>ZeroRows</li>\n<li>PosRows</li>\n<li>NegRows</li>\n<li>fmA</li>\n<li>fmB</li>\n</ul>",
